    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/7/87450.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 90,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, I guess we'll give them a pass on that. We'll give them a pass on that. Ralph, I have a question for you in light of this interview. And David brought this up before the show started. This is a narrow majority that the Democrats have. What role does the filibuster play in this? Will the Republicans still be able to block things? How do you see this dynamic playing out?",
