      },
      {
        "text": "Public investment in people, infrastructure, and public works is strategically beneficial on political, economic, and humanitarian grounds.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The Republicans would then have an effective veto power over legislation.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Joe Biden was inconsistent and unpredictable during his time in the Senate.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "High campaign contributions from wealthy donors limit democratic responsiveness.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Joe Biden currently recognizes the severity of national challenges facing the U.S.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Biden needs to exceed FDR’s achievements in terms of policy ambition.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
