      {
        "text": "Richard Trump began his career working in coal mines and rose through union ranks before becoming a lawyer and holding high positions in both the United Mine Workers and the AFL.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Criticism of Richard Trump's directorship at the FLCIO has not been particularly aggressive.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Public employee unions are strongly aligned with corporate-friendly Democratic values.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Industrial unions have experienced significant membership decline.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Richard Trump lacked sufficient strength to advocate effectively for a minimum wage increase under Obama.",
        "confidence": 0.85
